\begin_layout Standard
The restructured code reproduces the previous version (
\begin_inset Flex Code
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout
SpinlessJunction
\end_layout

\end_inset

) to better than 
\begin_inset Formula $3\times10^{-8}$
\end_inset

 in the currents for orders 1–3 (October 2026).
 Before the clean-up,
